---
// Creative Development & Talent Incubation Section
---
<section class="py-20 bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border-b border-[var(--color-border-subtle)]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent-amber)] mb-2">
        Capacity Building & Industry Pathways
      </h2>
      <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
        Beyond Screenings: Nurturing Rwanda's Creative Leaders
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        MUSANABANDI equips young Black creators with disabilities to become certified directors, screenwriters, sound designers, and producers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] overflow-hidden hover:border-[var(--color-accent-amber)] transition-all flex flex-col">
        <img
          src="/images/creative-adaptive-lab.jpg"
          alt="Young Rwandan filmmakers and students gathered around an adaptive cinema camera rig in a hands-on workshop"
          width="600"
          height="300"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-44 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-6 space-y-3 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Module 01</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Adaptive Filmmaking Labs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
              Masterclasses utilizing tactile focus gear, voice-assisted editing software, and wheelchair-accessible camera rigs.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] overflow-hidden hover:border-[var(--color-accent-amber)] transition-all flex flex-col">
        <img
          src="/images/creative-outdoor-workshop.jpg"
          alt="Young Rwandan creators actively collaborating and learning camera techniques together during an outdoor cinema lab"
          width="600"
          height="300"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-44 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-6 space-y-3 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Module 02</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Screenwriting & Story Incubators</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
              Mentorship pairing emerging Rwandan disabled youth with seasoned script doctors to craft broadcast-ready screenplays.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] overflow-hidden hover:border-[var(--color-accent-amber)] transition-all flex flex-col">
        <img
          src="/images/creative-studio-lighting.jpg"
          alt="Professional film production setup and camera operator in Rwanda on a broadcast studio stage"
          width="600"
          height="300"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-44 object-cover"
        />
        <div class="p-6 space-y-3 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--color-accent-amber)] uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Module 03</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Industry Apprenticeships</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mt-2">
              Connecting graduates directly with Rwandan broadcast stations, commercial studios, and international film co-productions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
